Algorithm:

Step 1: Start
Step 2: Open a web browser
Step 3: Go to www.gmail.com
Step 4: Enter the email ID and click "Next"
Step 5: If the email ID is invalid, display "Couldn't find your Google Account" and go to Step 4
Step 6: Enter the password and click "Next"
Step 7: If the password is wrong, display "Wrong password" and go to Step 6
Step 8: If 2-step verification is on, enter the OTP / approve on phone
Step 9: If the OTP is wrong, display "Wrong code" and go to Step 8
Step 10: Display the Gmail inbox (login successful)
Step 11: Stop

